From: Maxim Orlov <orlovmg@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:55:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH v1900 10/12] Use portable 64-bit XID formats throughout adapted PG19 paths

Adapt xid64 patch 0010 while preserving PG19-only checkpoint, VM, upgrade, logical replication and lock-key behavior. Keep safe parsed temporary values and signed base-shift diagnostics. Preserve native PID/file-size casts with explicit int64 formats.
